# `tauri dev` restarts the app when anything under src-tauri changes. These
# are only read at build time, or written by the build itself (tauri-build
# regenerates gen/ whenever cargo check/clippy/test runs its build script),
# and on Windows an indexer or antivirus touching them was enough to restart.
app-icon.svg
icons/
gen/
build.rs
Cargo.lock
